---
layout: base.njk
title: ""
description: "Perception is a transparent modular digital audio workstation: timeline, signal-flow patch bay, and bus routing in one native studio."
---

<section class="hero grid-backdrop">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="hero-header">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot dot-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>Transparent Modular DAW</p>
      <h1>Every wire visible.<br>Every sample earned.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        <strong>Perception</strong> unites an arrangement timeline, a per-track modular signal-flow studio,
        and a transparent stereo bus mixer in one native application — with zero hidden processing,
        isolated VST3 workers, and one clean JSON project file.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#patch-bay">Explore the signal flow</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/modules/">Browse 36+ DSP modules</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/architecture/">Read the architecture</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="studio-window" aria-label="Perception studio views">
      <div class="window-chrome">
        <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="view-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Studio pages">
          {% for view in site.views %}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="view-tab"
            role="tab"
            id="tab-{{ view.id }}"
            aria-controls="panel-{{ view.id }}"
            aria-selected="{% if loop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
            data-view-tab="{{ view.id }}"
          >{{ view.label }}</button>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <span class="mono dim" style="font-size:0.76rem">Click preview to inspect</span>
      </div>

      <div class="window-stage">
        {% for view in site.views %}
        <figure
          class="stage-panel"
          id="panel-{{ view.id }}"
          role="tabpanel"
          aria-labelledby="tab-{{ view.id }}"
          data-view-panel="{{ view.id }}"
          {% if not loop.first %}hidden{% endif %}
        >
          <button
            type="button"
            class="stage-trigger"
            data-lightbox-src="{{ view.image }}"
            data-lightbox-alt="{{ view.alt }}"
            data-lightbox-title="Perception — {{ view.label }}"
            data-lightbox-caption="{{ view.caption }}"
          >
            <img
              src="{{ view.image }}"
              alt="{{ view.alt }}"
              {% if loop.first %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy"{% endif %}
              decoding="async"
            >
          </button>
          <figcaption class="stage-caption">
            <span>{{ view.caption }}</span>
            <span class="mono">48 kHz · Stereo · Master only</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signal-legend" aria-label="Signal cable legend">
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="wire-sample wire-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>Audio / Signal (solid)</span>
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="wire-sample wire-mod" aria-hidden="true"></span>Modulation / Control (dashed)</span>
      <span class="legend-item"><span class="wire-sample wire-monitor" aria-hidden="true"></span>Monitor / Analysis (solid)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="patch-bay">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot dot-mod" aria-hidden="true"></span>Interactive Signal Flow</p>
      <h2>Click any node to inspect the live graph</h2>
      <p>
        Every track in Perception is a typed signal graph. Select a module below to see its
        parameters, modulation inlets, and route to Master.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="patch-studio">
      <div class="patch-canvas">
        <div class="patch-grid">
          <button type="button" class="node-card is-selected" data-node="exciter" aria-pressed="true">
            <div class="node-kicker"><span>Node 0</span><span>Source</span></div>
            <p class="node-title">Exciter 0</p>
            <div class="node-readout">Strength: 0.90</div>
            <div class="node-ports">
              <span class="port-badge">Gate</span>
              <span class="port-badge">Out <span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
            </div>
          </button>

          <button type="button" class="node-card" data-node="waveguide" aria-pressed="false">
            <div class="node-kicker"><span>Node 2</span><span>Physical</span></div>
            <p class="node-title">Waveguide 2</p>
            <div class="node-readout">Pitch: 261.63 Hz</div>
            <div class="node-ports">
              <span class="port-badge"><span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span> In</span>
              <span class="port-badge">Out <span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
            </div>
          </button>

          <button type="button" class="node-card" data-node="filter" aria-pressed="false">
            <div class="node-kicker"><span>Node 3</span><span>Filter</span></div>
            <p class="node-title">Mod Lowpass 3</p>
            <div class="node-readout">Cutoff: 1,840 Hz</div>
            <div class="node-ports">
              <span class="port-badge"><span class="socket socket-mod" aria-hidden="true"></span> Cutoff</span>
              <span class="port-badge">Scope <span class="socket socket-monitor" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
            </div>
          </button>

          <button type="button" class="node-card" data-node="grain" aria-pressed="false">
            <div class="node-kicker"><span>Node 4</span><span>Granular</span></div>
            <p class="node-title">Grain Cloud 4</p>
            <div class="node-readout">Pool: 16 · Rate -0.5×</div>
            <div class="node-ports">
              <span class="port-badge">WAV 48k</span>
              <span class="port-badge">Stereo <span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
            </div>
          </button>

          <button type="button" class="node-card" data-node="bus" aria-pressed="false">
            <div class="node-kicker"><span>Group</span><span>Stereo Bus</span></div>
            <p class="node-title">Undertow Bus</p>
            <div class="node-readout">Detector: kick · 4.0×</div>
            <div class="node-ports">
              <span class="port-badge"><span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span> Dry + Send</span>
              <span class="port-badge">Master <span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
            </div>
          </button>

          <button type="button" class="node-card" data-node="master" aria-pressed="false">
            <div class="node-kicker"><span>Sink</span><span>Master Only</span></div>
            <p class="node-title">Master</p>
            <div class="node-readout">Stereo · No hidden DSP</div>
            <div class="node-ports">
              <span class="port-badge"><span class="socket" aria-hidden="true"></span> Sum L/R</span>
              <span class="port-badge">DAC / WAV</span>
            </div>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="patch-inspector" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="inspector-kicker" id="inspector-kicker">Source · Node 0</p>
        <h3 class="inspector-title" id="inspector-title">Exciter 0</h3>
        <p class="inspector-desc" id="inspector-desc">
          Single-period filtered noise impulse that energizes waveguide and modal chains.
        </p>
        <ul class="inspector-list" id="inspector-list">
          <li><span class="dim">Strength</span><span class="mono">0.90</span></li>
          <li><span class="dim">Follow</span><span class="mono">Struck (velocity)</span></li>
          <li><span class="dim">Outlet 0</span><span class="mono">→ Strike comb 1</span></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot dot-monitor" aria-hidden="true"></span>Core Invariants</p>
      <h2>Built for sound designers who refuse black boxes</h2>
      <p>
        Perception replaces hidden mixers, proprietary binary blobs, and fragile plug-in crashes
        with verifiable signal-flow invariants.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-tag">Signal Transparency</span>
        <h3>Zero hidden processing</h3>
        <p>
          Every gain, EQ, compressor, send, and limiter is a visible node or control.
          There is no secret limiter, clipper, or auto-gain anywhere — Master included.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-tag is-monitor">Master-Only Engine</span>
        <h3>One graph for Play and Render</h3>
        <p>
          Playing streams Master blocks straight to the speakers without writing files.
          Rendering writes Master untouched to <code class="mono">song.wav</code>. No hidden stems.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-tag is-mod">Isolated VST3 Workers</span>
        <h3>Crash-proof plug-in hosting</h3>
        <p>
          Every scanned VST3 bundle runs in its own bounded worker process with sample-accurate
          MIDI, automation, and state restoration — never inside the UI thread.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-tag">One JSON File</span>
        <h3>Human-readable projects</h3>
        <p>
          Arrangement notes, per-track modular patches, bus trees, outlet sends, and canvas
          positions all save into one schema-validated JSON project file.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot dot-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>Real Studio Captures</p>
      <h2>From hand-written arrangements to complex bus trees</h2>
      <p>
        Every screenshot below is captured straight from the native Perception studio running real
        hand-composed projects like <em>Silt Relay</em> and <em>Broken Circuitry: Reassembly</em>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for shot in site.gallery %}
      <article class="shot-card">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="shot-btn"
          data-lightbox-src="{{ shot.image }}"
          data-lightbox-alt="{{ shot.title }}"
          data-lightbox-title="{{ shot.title }}"
          data-lightbox-caption="{{ shot.caption }}"
        >
          <img src="{{ shot.image }}" alt="{{ shot.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </button>
        <div class="shot-meta">
          <span class="card-tag">{{ shot.tag }}</span>
          <h3>{{ shot.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ shot.caption }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
